{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-1","kind":"proposition","title":"寻找给定圆的圆心","englishTitle":"To find the centre of a given circle.","book":3,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","contentId":"euclid-3-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eaba99dc94de1b8f003fea36c44ae80b605e9e070c843f7d20fb8e98d27339ef","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-1.statement","euclid-3-1.construction.1","euclid-3-1.construction.2","euclid-3-1.proof.1","euclid-3-1.proof.2","euclid-3-1.proof.3","euclid-3-1.proof.4","euclid-3-1.proof.5","euclid-3-1.conclusion","euclid-3-1.historical.1","euclid-3-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"312855829ec35115d1216c641e01436d6e320790fec88d7eba3ecb523605351a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the centre of a given circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到一个特定圆的中心"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求寻其心"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"寻找圆心"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2ca6b44ec82cfe2dd832bdcc0224a8746ceaf112fc3c46601792e5955eecb3a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given circle; thus it is required to find the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC是给定的圆;因此,需要找到ABC圆的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30416dd53d873012fd186ab84b461ea4f04618655068f856aeecfcccb967eec9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a straight line AB be drawn through it at random, and let it be bisected at the point D; from D let DC be drawn at right angles to AB and let it be drawn through to E; let CE be bisected at F; I say that F is the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"随机通过一条AB线,在D点将这条线分为两部分;从直角到AB分从D到DC分划到E分;F分划到CE分;我说F分是ABC圈的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb42d208a80c00a1c9c5b0d2a3dbd77f922c73aa90b016eec9c19fa8a94a781a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it is not, but, if possible, let G be the centre, and let GA, GD, GB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设不是,但如果可能,让G成为中心,让GA,GD,GB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09a4c9afee15bcf8b7d3fb2c05382eecf55d82c87be3b74a489668a7040859e3","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AD is equal to DB, and DG is common, the two sides AD, DG are equal to the two sides BD, DG respectively; and the base GA is equal to the base GB, for they are radii; therefore the angle ADG is equal to the angle GDB. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"双方AD和DG是共同的,因此,双方AD和DG是分别的BD和DG;底边和GA是底边和GB,因为它们是射线;因此,角度ADG等于角度GDB。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"831e5ceac70342cf085354f92efaa0e442eeb3c5a9945f4fbacefb217b720d78","citations":["euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, when a straight line set up on a straight line makes the adjacent angles equal to one another, each of the equal angles is right; [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)] therefore the angle GDB is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,当一条直线上设置的直线使相邻角等同,那么,每一个等角都是对的;因此,GDB角是正确的。 [[I. Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e095aa095c59dfd5a8f19b23fa536eb1935b96607fa41f12667c38a58510865a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle FDB is also right; therefore the angle FDB is equal to the angle GDB, the greater to the less: which is impossible. Therefore G is not the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度FDB也是对的;因此角度FDB等于角度GDB,数量更大到数量较少:这是不可能的。因此,G不是ABC圆的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"410b8782c8085be3b572d0631429c095e7a485247718c4882eb444b439b22f96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other point except F. Therefore the point F is the centre of the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明除了F点以外,这两个点都没有别的地方。 因此,F点是ABC圈的中心。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1b7e3969cc3e9c337a16d344490203389ad6f66a04604601c1cfbe06c868529","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if in a circle a straight line cut a straight line into two equal parts and at right angles, the centre of the circle is on the cutting straight line. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱。 从这一点可以看出,如果在圆形中,一条直线将一条直线切成两个相等的部分,直角时,圆的中心线将划为直线。 Q. E. F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f473cbedcae8bf506344a84aec2de257dba3f954a6b947f7ee25b0ed20d927dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有圜求寻其心法曰甲乙丙丁圜求寻其心先于圜之两界任作一甲丙直线次两平分之于戊〈一卷〉〈十〉次于戊上作乙丁垂线两平分之于己即己为圜心论曰如云不然令言心何在彼不得言在己之上下何者乙丁线既平分于己离平分不能为心故必言心在乙丁线外为庚即令自庚至丙至戊至甲各作直线则甲庚戊角形之甲戊既与丙庚戊角形之丙戊两边等戊庚同边而庚甲庚丙两线俱从心至界宜亦等即对等边之庚戊甲庚戊丙两角宜亦等〈一卷八〉而为两直角矣〈一卷界说十〉夫乙戊甲既直角而庚戊甲又为直角可不可也系因此推显圜内有直线分他线为两平分而作直角即圜心在其内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于一个圆，找到它的中心并按如下方式绘制：甲乙丙丁 找到圆心，先画圆的任意两条边界，甲丙 在 戊〈一卷〉〈十〉 上画一条平分线，然后在 戊 上画 乙丁，在 己 上画垂直平分线，即 己 是圆心。证明如下：如果不是这样，那么不能说心在 己 的上方或下方。因为 乙丁 线被 己 平分，所以不能被认为是心。因此，必须说心在 乙丁 线之外，即 庚。如果从 庚 画直线到 丙，再到 戊，再到 甲，那么三角形 甲庚戊 的 甲戊 和三角形 丙庚戊 的 丙戊 在 戊庚 的同一边，并且两条线 庚甲庚丙 从中心到边界应该相等，意味着等边的两个角 庚戊甲庚戊丙 也应等于 〈一卷八〉 形成两个直角。〈一卷界说十〉 乙戊甲 是两个直角，庚戊甲 也是直角。这是因为推测圆内有一条线，而 庚戊甲 也是直角。因此可以推测圆内有一条线，而 丙戊 被平分并画出直角，中心在内部。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-1.source","contentId":"euclid-3-1","revisionId":"euclid-3-1@raw-eaba99dc94de1b8f","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"32087cbb19d559b385556212e3719ab4362724ea57692016160a2aa131e19a98","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-1:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-1.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.1","sourceUrl":"ht